CNI88277_process_crash_without_RU_reset
    [Documentation]
    ...  Purpose of this test case is to check RMOD's Core Dumps collection after process crash which does not cause RMOD
    ...  autonomous reset. Autonomous snapshot (triggered by fault 4527 detection) with Full coverage will be verified during the test.
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param int rmod_id: (Mandatory) : RMOD configuration id of tested radio module, e.g.: 1
    ...  :param int name_of_process: (Mandatory) : name of process to be killed on particular RMOD
    ...  :param int root_process: (Optional) : True if given process name is running as root, False otherwise. Defaults to False
    ...  :param str snapshot_name: (Optional) : name of snapshot to save and verify during the test, defaults to snapshot_cni_88277.zip
    ...  :param str snapshot_dir_path: (Optional) : absolute dir path to save snapshot file witch will be verified during the test,
    ...                                             defaults path to test logs set during test setup.
    ...  :param str ims_name: (Optional) : name of IMS2 log (without extension) to save and verify alarms during the test,
    ...                                    defaults to: ims2_snapshot_cni_88277
    ...  :param str ims_dir_name: (Optional) : directory name to save IMS2 file which will be used to verify alarms during the test,
    ...                                        defaults to: ims2_snapshot_cni88277
    ...  :param str send_snapshot_to_scrambling_verification: (Optional) : True if snapshot with core dumps collected during test case
    ...                                                                    should be send on external server to scrambling verification,
    ...                                                                    False otherwise. Defaults to False
    ...  :param str team_name: team name required to archive snapshot and sent to external server, defaults to 'PZ1WRO4'

    [Arguments]    ${rmod_id}
    ...            ${name_of_process}
    ...            ${root_process}=${False}
    ...            ${snapshot_name}=snapshot_cni88277_without_rmod_reset.zip
    ...            ${snapshot_dir_path}=${logs_path}
    ...            ${ims_name}=ims2_snapshot_cni88277
    ...            ${ims_dir_name}=ims2_snapshot_cni88277
    ...            ${team_name}=PZ1WRO4
    ...            ${send_snapshot_to_scrambling_verification}=${False}

    ${bts_type}                                             hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}                                           connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${all_rmods_ids}                                        Get all RMODs index values
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${mrbts_id}                                             admin_info_model.get_mrbts_id_admin
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    ${initial_actCoreDumpFileCollection_value}              Get actCoreDumpFileCollection SCF Parameter Value
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Run keyword if                                          """${initial_actCoreDumpFileCollection_value}""" != """false"""
    ...                                                     Set actCoreDumpFileCollection SCF Parameter
    ...                                                     parameter_value=false
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Perform Site Reset And Wait On OnAir                    bts_type=${bts_type}

    Set actCoreDumpFileCollection SCF Parameter             parameter_value=true
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Configure Diagnostic Snapshot Triggering when 4527 Detected
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    Set Test Variable                                       ${return_to_initial_scf}
    ...                                                     ${True}

    ${4527_alarm_instance}                                  alarms_watchdog.create_alarm
    ...                                                     alarm_id=7115
    ...                                                     fault_id=4527
    ...                                                     severity=Minor
    ims_alarm_verifier.set_start_timestamp

    Alarms.Allow alarm                                      fault_id=4527
    ...                                                     alarm_id=7115
    ...                                                     severity=Minor
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Kill Process on RMOD                                    rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     process_name=${name_of_process}
    ...                                                     signal_number=11
    ...                                                     root_process=${root_process}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    snapshot.watch_for_autonomous_snapshot_initialization_in_background_task
    ...                                                     mrbts_id=${mrbts_id}
    ...                                                     timeout=180

    ${4527_appearance_timeout}                              Set Variable
    ...                                                     120
    Robot Log Step                                          Waiting ${4527_appearance_timeout}s for FID:4527 to appear...
    Sleep                                                   ${4527_appearance_timeout}s
    ...                                                     reason=Waiting ${4527_appearance_timeout}s for FID:4527 to appear...
    ims_alarm_verifier.set_end_timestamp

    ${ims_cni88277_path}                                    Collect IM Snapshot With Custom Name And Directory
    ...                                                     directory_name=${ims_dir_name}
    ...                                                     file_name=${ims_name}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Robot Log Step                                          Checking IM Snapshot if 'Radio Diagnostic Files collected' FID:4527 appeared...
    ${4527_ims_info}=                                       ims_alarm_verifier.verify_alarm_was_set
    ...                                                     alarm=${4527_alarm_instance}
    ...                                                     ims_file_path=${ims_cni88277_path}
    ims_alarm_verifier.set_start_timestamp

    Check all BBMODs RMODs and cells states for all RATs

    ${autonomous_snapshot_name}                             Wait for Autonomous Snapshot Collection
    ...                                                     timeout=600

    # Coredumps can be sill available on RMODs after snapshot collection due to requirement RFREQ_6506 exclusion.
    Run keyword and ignore error                            Check Core Dumps on RMOD
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     should_be_present=${False}

    Prepare Collected Autonomous Snapshot                   autonomous_snapshot_name=${autonomous_snapshot_name}
    ...                                                     snapshot_archive_name=${snapshot_name}
    ...                                                     snapshot_archive_dir_patch=${snapshot_dir_path}

    ${path_to_copy_of_core_dump_file}                       Verify if Snapshot Contains Core Dumps Logs
    ...                                                     snapshot_dir_path=${snapshot_dir_path}
    ...                                                     snapshot_name=${snapshot_name}
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     name_of_process=${name_of_process}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Verify Encryption in Core Dump File                     coredump_file_path=${path_to_copy_of_core_dump_file}

    Verify if RMODs Snapshot SOAP Contains Core Dumps Logs and Triggered Alarm
    ...                                                     snapshot_dir_path=${snapshot_dir_path}
    ...                                                     snapshot_name=${snapshot_name}
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     alarm_id=2933
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Robot Log Result                                        Snapshot file ${snapshot_name} is verified successfully.
    ...                                                     to_console=${True}

    Run keyword if                                          ${send_snapshot_to_scrambling_verification}
    ...                                                     Run keyword and continue on failure
    ...                                                     Collect and send logs for scrambling verification
    ...                                                     team_name=${team_name}
    ...                                                     input_logs_dir=${snapshot_dir_path}

    ${4527_clearing_timeout}                                Set Variable
    ...                                                     900
    Robot Log Step                                          Waiting ${4527_clearing_timeout}s for FID:4527 to be cleared...
    Sleep                                                   ${4527_clearing_timeout}s
    ...                                                     reason=Waiting ${4527_clearing_timeout}s for FID:4527 to be cleared

    ims_alarm_verifier.set_end_timestamp
    ${ims_cni88277_path_removed_alarm}                      Collect IM Snapshot With Custom Name And Directory
    ...                                                     directory_name=${ims_dir_name}_removed_alarm
    ...                                                     file_name=${ims_name}_removed_alarm
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Robot Log Step                                          Checking IM Snapshot if 'Radio Diagnostic Files collected' FID:4527 was removed...
    ims_alarm_verifier.verify_alarm_was_removed             alarm_dist_name=${4527_ims_info["dist_name"]}
    ...                                                     ims_file_path=${ims_cni88277_path_removed_alarm}

    Alarms.Disallow alarm                                   fault_id=4527
    ...                                                     alarm_id=7115
    ...                                                     severity=Minor
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    [Teardown]                                              Teardown for Test Case with Process Crash
    ...                                                     initial_actCoreDumpFileCollection_value=${initial_actCoreDumpFileCollection_value}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}


Kill Process on RMOD
    [Arguments]    ${rmod_id}
    ...            ${process_name}
    ...            ${signal_number}
    ...            ${root_process}
    ...            ${connection}

    Robot Log Step                                          Killing process '${process_name}' on RMOD-${rmod_id}...
    ${killed_pid}                                           rmod_ops.kill_rmod_process_by_name
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     process_name=${process_name}
    ...                                                     signal_number=${signal_number}
    ...                                                     root_process=${root_process}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Robot Log Result                                        PID: ${killed_pid} has been killed on RMOD-${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     to_console=${True}

    Sleep                                                   10s
    ...                                                     reason=Waiting 10s after killing the process...
    Check all BBMODs RMODs and cells states for all RATs


Wait for Autonomous Snapshot Collection
    [Arguments]    ${timeout}

    Robot Log Step                                          Waiting for autonomous snapshot collection...
    ${autonomous_snapshot_name}                             snapshot.wait_and_collect_autonomous_snapshot_name_from_background_task
    Should contain                                          ${autonomous_snapshot_name}
    ...                                                     Snapshot
    ...                                                     msg=Incorrect found autonomous snapshot name: ${autonomous_snapshot_name}
    snapshot.wait_for_autonomous_snapshot_collection        snapshot_name=${autonomous_snapshot_name}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}
    Robot Log Result                                        Autonomous snapshot collection succeeded with name: ${autonomous_snapshot_name}

    [Return]     ${autonomous_snapshot_name}


Prepare Collected Autonomous Snapshot
    [Arguments]    ${autonomous_snapshot_name}
    ...            ${snapshot_archive_name}
    ...            ${snapshot_archive_dir_patch}

    Robot Log Step                                          Preparing collected autonomous snapshot...
    ${snapshot_archive_path}                                snapshot.compress_snapshot_directory
    ...                                                     snapshot_name=${autonomous_snapshot_name}
    ...                                                     archive_name=${snapshot_archive_name}
    ...                                                     archive_dir=${snapshot_archive_dir_patch}

    [Return]     ${snapshot_archive_path}
